# Zephyr sources only the four files at the vendor root; anything in the series
# sub-directories has to be pulled in from here.

# Not wrapped in "if SOC_FAMILY_BEKEN_ARM": the series selects the family, so
# the family condition would make the two symbols depend on each other and
# kconfig would report a dependency loop.
rsource "*/Kconfig"
